DPWR-DETR partial reference implementation

The multi-scale deformable attention implementation is adapted from the
Ultralytics RT-DETR implementation and upstream Deformable DETR work. Refer to
the source comments in dpwr_detr/dird.py and the AGPL-3.0 license distributed
with this repository.

Upstream references:
- https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics
- https://github.com/fundamentalvision/Deformable-DETR
- https://github.com/IDEA-Research/detrex
